PURPOSE
H74 keeps developmental softening strictly cell-local.

H75 asks a more tissue-like question:

SHOULD PLASTICITY ITSELF PROPAGATE LOCALLY?

If one region is damaged,
nearby cells may benefit from becoming:
temporarily easier to repurpose

before:
the redistributed workload fully reaches them.

Potential gain:
faster repair / role redistribution.

Potential failure:
one local disturbance causes:
whole-tissue de-differentiation.

BOUNDARY
This is synthetic.

It does not:
- freeze a production plasticity-field equation;
- freeze a two-hop radius;
- prove real Yggdrasil injury sensing has this geometry;
- authorize global de-specialization;
- modify or execute STAB-18-R1.

EVIDENCE
SYNTHETIC
MEASURED_SANDBOX

SPATIAL TISSUE
20 x 20 cells.

Pre-existing role pattern:

left half:
role A.

right half:
role B.

Cells begin:
fully canalized.

LOCAL DAMAGE
Central 6 x 6 tissue block is unavailable during:

steps 300..399.

A surrounding repair margin is defined as:

the local 2-cell ring around the damaged block.

REDISTRIBUTED WORK
Damage signal begins at:

step 300.

The repair-margin workload changes at:

step 320.

Thus:
injury information arrives before
the new role demand fully appears.

The repair margin must reverse:
its previous role orientation.

This creates a clean test of:
preparatory local softening.

FUNCTIONAL SERVICE
A cell's current role orientation determines:
how well it serves the current local task.

Current canalization contributes:
a specialization-capacity bonus.

Therefore:
unnecessary softening
has a real service cost.

POLICIES

CELL-LOCAL ONLY
No plasticity field.

Cells soften only when:
their own local role mismatch appears.

SHORT DIFFUSIVE FIELD
A weak local plasticity signal spreads from:
injured tissue.

LONG-RANGE DIFFUSIVE FIELD
A stronger / more persistent field spreads through:
most of the organism.

BOUNDED-RADIUS FIELD
Damage emits:
a finite local softening signal

with:
explicitly bounded hop radius.

Primary working point:

radius:
2 local hops.

per-hop attenuation:
0.80.

The field suppresses:
CURRENT CANALIZATION EXPRESSION

but does NOT rewrite:
slow canalization memory.

