PRIMARY HARD NEGATIVE
Fast local adaptation can be purchased by:

DE-SPECIALIZING MOST OF THE ORGANISM.

That is not acceptable.

A long-range plasticity field turns:
local novelty

into:
global developmental softness.

This is the metaplastic analogue of:
probe storms
and
wake storms.

